# vvaharness/scope/walk.py

The deterministic repository walk that defines the scan scope: built-in plus configured directory, extension and glob exclusions, a size cap, an unconditional guard against symlinks that escape the repository, and the helpers that normalize model-emitted paths back to inventory form. Also holds the config-dedup defaults and the secret and insecure-value patterns.

